            "subscribe",
            "notifications",
            "followers"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "likes",
          "question": "How do likes work?",
          "answer": "Likes let users show appreciation for posts or comments. They may contribute to engagement metrics and help Panorra identify content that users find valuable.",
